    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0327" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg319"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.51/957: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-09-29T21:00:00-05:00">September 29,
                            1939—9 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>28. It will be a serious embarrassment if I do not receive reply immediately to
                    my cables in regard to the Bolivian advance and I earnestly hope it will enable
                    me to enter into satisfactory exchange of letters tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
